IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WORD PIC X(4) VALUE "ABCD".
01 CHARS REDEFINES WORD.
   05 C1 PIC X.
   05 C2 PIC X.
   05 C3 PIC X.
   05 C4 PIC X.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY C1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING C1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "A"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [A] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY C2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING C2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "B"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [B] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY C3.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING C3 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "C"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [C] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY C4.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING C4 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "D"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [D] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

